        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Modification from Unimod. Phosphoserine is converted to dehydroalanine then by Michael addition of ethanethiol to S-ethylcysteine. Needs parent and sibling for S-ethyl-cysteine.</rdfs:comment>
