        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A protein modification that inserts or replaces a residue with a natural, non-standard encoded residue, such as N-formyl-L-methionine, L-selenocysteine, or L-pyrrolysine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <mod:Origin rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">X</mod:Origin>
