        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mod#PSI-MOD-slim"/>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">These are produced exclusively by modification of amino acids acylated to special tRNA before incorporation by ribosomes into proteins. For this reason, they have also been referred to as pre-translational modifications.</rdfs:comment>
