        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cross-link 2; From DeltaMass with no citation or formula: Average Mass: -18. The DeltaMass description &quot;Serine crosslinked to theta or pi carbon of Histidine&quot; is incorrect. The histidine ring nitrogens (not carbons) are designated tele or N-tau (not theta), and pros or N-pi [JSG].</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">alaninohistidine (serine crosslinked to tele or pros nitrogen of histidine)</rdfs:label>
