        <oboInOwl:id rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MOD:01106</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">From DeltaMass with no citation or formula: Average Mass: 214. It is not clear what this is supposed to represent. The mass corresponds to an N-formyl tryptophan (either N2 or N1&apos;), but neither of these modifications has been reported as commonly encountered. It may have been confused with N&apos;-formyl-L-kynurenine, see MOD:00464 [JSG]</rdfs:comment>
