        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Occurs on His-tagged proteins expresssed in E. coli.From DeltaMass: Average Mass: 258 Formula: C6H10O6HPO3 Monoisotopic Mass Change: 258.01 Average Mass Change: 258.12 References: Geoghegan, K. F., H. B. Dixon, et al. (1999). Spontaneous alpha-N-6-phosphogluconoylation of a His tag in Escherichia coli: the cause of extra mass of 258 or 178 Da in fusion proteins. Anal Biochem 267(1): 169-84. Mass is one Da higher because this is an N-terminal modification</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">alpha-N-6-phosphogluconoylated L-histidine</rdfs:label>
