        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A protein modification that forms L-cystine by forming a disulfide bond that either cross-links two peptidyl L-cysteine residues, or modifies a peptidyl cysteine with a free cysteine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
