        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This modification can be produced by hydrogen cyanate, either as a reagent or as released by urea degradation. This modification effectively blocks Edman degradation, and because it can dehydrate to a cyanate group and react with another peptide N-terminal, it can effectively block two peptide molecules [JSG].</rdfs:comment>
