        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Polypeptides with monomethylated amino terminals can undergo premature cleavage during the coupling step of an Edman degradation. This can result in &quot;preview&quot; with both a residue and the following residue being seen from the first step on through a sequence [JSG].</rdfs:comment>
