        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">For amino acids residues, amine trimethylation can effectively only be accomplished with an aminium, protonated primary amino, group. This process accounts only for trimethylation and not protonation. The alternative N2Me3+Res process (MOD:01698) accounts for both protonation and trimethylation.</rdfs:comment>
