        <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">It is expected that this neutral loss will produce a mix of (E)- and (Z)-isomers [JSG].</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">dehydrobutyrine (Met)</rdfs:label>
