        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A protein modification that effectively replaces a hydrogen atom of a residue with one of the Applied Biosystems mTRAQ reagent reporter+balance groups.</obo:IAO_0000115>
